%% UC-02 Reserve Meeting Room, then admin accepts
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant W as Web App (Next.js)
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant R as Reservation Service
    participant L as Library Service
    participant U as User Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (reservation)
    actor A as Admin

    C->>W: Choose room, start time, duration
    W->>G: POST /api/reservations (JWT)
    G->>G: Verify JWT, add X-Request-ID
    Note over G: Pick a healthy Reservation instance from Consul (round-robin)
    G->>R: POST /api/reservations
    Note over R,U: Library and User instances are resolved through Consul (consul://library, consul://user)
    R->>L: gRPC GetRoom(room_id)
    L-->>R: Room
    R->>U: REST GET /api/users/{id} (viewProfile)
    U-->>R: { active_penalty }
    R->>DB: SELECT active bookings of user
    R->>R: quotaCheck (2 active, 180 min/day, penalty)
    alt penalty or quota exceeded
        R-->>G: 403 penalty / 422 quota_exceeded
    else room free
        R->>DB: BEGIN, lock room rows, INSERT status=pending, COMMIT
        alt slot taken concurrently
            DB-->>R: overlap (EXCLUDE constraint)
            R-->>G: 409 conflict
        else inserted
            R-->>G: 201 Created (pending)
        end
    end
    G-->>W: response
    W-->>C: Show result / pick another room

    A->>W: Accept booking
    W->>G: POST /api/reservations/{id}/accept (admin JWT)
    G->>R: forward
    R->>DB: status=accepted, reference, check-in deadline = start + 15 min
    R-->>G: 200 (reference / QR code)
    G-->>W: 200
